{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e768bbf7c3cfde9dcc455790b25b86c420021ae9e04cf3677748a8e670c5edc0","ja":"「ボクが一番だよ！」「オレだって！」\n「ターッチ！　次はお前オニね！」「まて～っ！」","zh":"“我才是第一名！”“我也一样！”\n“抓——到啦！下一个你当鬼！”“等等我——！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"9f123085c5de997c6ebe35c80a53e7931182125f4c98f073c732f489b1d6515b","ja":"まいったな……\nどうやったら、落ち着かせられるんだ？","zh":"真伤脑筋啊……\n要怎么做才能让她冷静下来呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"2905e3555d76b3c741938a9b3f66d51cf97cf831b5d8cf1de120196b4594a3a3","ja":"みんな、ギターが気になって来たんだから\nちゃんと聞いてくれればいいのに……あっ！","zh":"大家明明是因为对吉他感兴趣才过来的，\n好好听一听不就好了嘛……啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"034f869c42965b3c370eed43031d03432b58faedae492056a50c6d5ff6abd7aa","ja":"ねぇ、ジュリアさん！\n何か一曲、ひいてみて？","zh":"呐，茱莉亚先生！\n随便弹一首听听嘛？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"39a949f63479765cb7ab7e5aa38ff11d9d8ddffaebd868e5bff13f8271aef88f","ja":"あ？　ああ。よくわかんないけど、わかった。\nそれじゃ、あたしのお気に入りナンバーを……。","zh":"啊？啊啊。虽然没太搞懂，不过我知道了。\n那么，就来一首我最喜欢的曲子……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"f2304194b2460b71770c0e3503a978c1a159c39f2c9394f47ce8e8aa8c3b4500","ja":"「わあっ……」「すごい！」\n「やっぱり、かっこいいね！」","zh":"「哇啊……」「好厉害！」\n「果然好帅气啊！」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"ae9ac09bf80205bcc38e494f4da8d92908bd9c3d4a433ed2759700252972cb1c","ja":"（おっ、みんなが注目しだした……）","zh":"（哦，大家开始关注起来了……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"fa1d6f4be5246273ed7ca2e04eda01cac123374ec5aa9156d5a0b36b1f4201a2","ja":"パチパチパチパチパチ……！！","zh":"啪啪啪啪啪……！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7cb3e9f14f9749520730541bf9c03a613552059cf4898459935502a22e3c3efe","ja":"みんな、せっかく教えに来てくれたんだから、\nジュリア先生を、困らせたらダメだよ？","zh":"大家，老师难得特地来教我们，\n可不能让茱莉亚老师为难哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"c633e654143fe95724fe726c787ff8190471f71607f6278061534f516ef067fb","ja":"ジュリア先生みたいにひけるようになりたかったら、\nちゃんとお話を聞くこと！","zh":"要是想弹得像茱莉亚老师那样，\n就得好好听讲！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"bcca2a93a5cfa201e6936b9179fee58c13cfeb7153ca9cd4722344c60038fe85","ja":"「「「は～い！！」」」","zh":"「「「好～！！」」」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"19b77ede126a1a50ce0504fbec8754998438d3a602825d423cabd3e6864a7cb7","ja":"……すごいな、育。なんで演奏したら\nみんなが静かになるって、わかったんだ？","zh":"……真厉害啊，育。你怎么知道只要一演奏，\n大家就会安静下来的？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"2a843ad29b690aefdea92fc3a0e4148a3b783cb1e4f0cfe7a32461345885949b","ja":"だって、ジュリアさんのギターって、\nすっごくカッコイイから♪","zh":"因为茱莉亚弹吉他的样子，\n真的超级帅气嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"a4a9cf2114fb1f14f6400812b886d450960298bc94fa145613b77bec0363926b","ja":"みんなも、ジュリアさんのギターを聞いたら、\nちゅうもくしてくれるって思ったの。","zh":"我觉得要是大家听了茱莉亚的吉他演奏，\n肯定也会关注过来的。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"b374a744acf5ece62e4b2993081288d2e454bb0ab24415535b963f913f98f846","ja":"……はは、サンキュー。\nそこまで言われちゃ、応えなきゃロックじゃないな。","zh":"……哈哈，谢啦。\n被你说到这个份上，要是不回应可就不够摇滚了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1525.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4ea2f749141f4026884d01546d1ee6be2121fe85f67c7fb39eae81840bc84c64","ja":"よ～し、みんなしっかり聞いとけよ。\nギターのカッコイイとこ、いっぱい教えてやるぜ！","zh":"好～嘞，大家可要听仔细了。\n吉他的帅气之处，我全都会教给你们的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
